  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2025 Cuba Hurricane Melissa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Emergency Appeal aims to address the urgent needs of people affected by Hurricane Melissa in Cuba and the current Arbovirus outbreak. It will provide humanitarian assistance and recovery support to 100,000 people (30,000 households) in Santiago de Cuba, Granma, and Holgu&#xed;n over 24 months, while strengthening community resilience through the CRC and its volunteers.</narrative>
  </description>
